<td><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/%e6%98%9f%e5%ba%a7%e9%81%8b%e7%a8%8b/infp-infp%e6%80%a7%e6%a0%bc-16%e5%9e%8b%e4%ba%ba%e6%a0%bc-mbti-cplt1-1680035/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">INFP 調停者</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>資料來源：<a href=\"https://www.16personalities.com/tw/isfp-%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">16型人格</a></p>\n<h2>新假期編輯推薦：ESTJ男ENFP女｜MBTI配對指數、相處之道及情侶保持甜蜜關係方法</h2>\n<p>ESTJ男ENFP女 這對伴侶可能會帶來一些有趣的動態和挑戰。ESTJ男性可能會將重點放在事業和責任上，並且期望伴侶能夠支持他們的目標。ENFP女性則可能更關注情感和人際關係，並且希望伴侶能夠給予她們足夠的關注和理解。儘管ESTJ男和ENFP女在某些方面存在差異，但他們也可以互補彼此的弱點。ESTJ…<br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/mbti/estj%e7%94%b7enfp%e5%a5%b3-%e9%85%8d%e5%b0%8d%e6%8c%87%e6%95%b8-16%e5%9e%8b%e4%ba%ba%e6%a0%bc-mbti-cplt1-2-1689711/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">詳情請看</a>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T01:44:54.315915+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1992,"images":0,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T02:38:33.214441+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T01:38:26.491865+00:00","content_hash":"bad9395cca53684d8d195f9f97b92a845a5849d6d113cd384eea26811d086e83","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}